      "body": "Hi Dimitri,\n\nMy earlier note asked about tracing leads through to retained matters. I wrote a short article on why better software alone doesn't always make that easier.\n\nThe bigger challenge can be agreeing how intake and case teams share information and responsibility. That's shaping how we approach AI adoption at Possible Minds.\n\nhttps://getpossibleminds.com/t/ql-gv7Zh-w\n\nFrom your managing partner's perspective, which would take more work: connecting the tools or changing the team's routines? I'd value a quick take.\n\nBest,\nPranav\nFounder, Possible Minds",
